 s and layered sounds encourage mindfulness\, relaxation\, and a deeper con
 nection with yourself.\nHeld within our peaceful forest room\, this experi
 ence surrounds you with the calming presence of nature while providing a c
 omfortable environment to fully unwind. Bolsters\, blankets\, and mats are
  available to support your body so you can simply arrive\, get comfortable
 \, and let yourself rest.\nA sound bath can be a deeply personal experienc
 e. Some participants find moments of quiet reflection\, others experience 
